{"version":1,"content":"<p>10月10日剛剛卸任蘋果公司CEO的庫克（Tim Cook）以董事長的新身分第一次訪華。</p><p>今日（11日）下午2時許，庫克來到廣州天環廣場Apple Store零售店，並與攝影師潛光交流。</p><p>期間吸引無數果粉「追星」，讓整間蘋果零售店擠得水洩不通。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T13:38:05.511094+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T12:59:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T10:57:39.289204+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"84d78bd38dd0b28653f80cc5e39a7f7135d8b9d6a08df7369832c40cee4bb62f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}